OL,5,G1700 Blue Planet II
OL,6,     FCoral Reefs: Creatures that live
OL,7,     Fon coral reefs, including
OL,8,     Fgroupers, predators with a grasp
OL,9,     Fof communication that has led
OL,10,     Fscientists to conclude they're as
OL,11,     Fintelligent as chimpanzees.
OL,12,G1800 Blue Planet II
OL,13,     FBig Blue: Wildlife that live
OL,14,     Fthousands of kilometres from land,
OL,15,     Ffeaturing footage of baby turtles
OL,16,     Fusing debris as life rafts and
OL,17,     Fsperm whales hunting for squid
OL,18,     Fdeep beneath the surface.
