OL,5,G1900 Bangers & Cash: Restoring Classics
OL,6,     FThe Two Mercs/Fiesta ST: This week
OL,7,     Ftells the tale of the two Mercs,
OL,8,     Fbut what will the moral of the
OL,9,     Fstory be? Plus, the team get stuck
OL,10,     Finto a moddable favourite - a 2006
OL,11,     FFord Fiesta ST.
OL,12,G2000 Bangers & Cash
OL,13,     FMercedes 380SL, Vauxhall, Talbot
OL,14,     FSunbeam Lotus: Derek is reunited
OL,15,     Fwith a restored Mercedes SL, Paul
OL,16,     Fpicks up a historic rally car, and
OL,17,     Fa 1974 Vauxhall VX sells for a
OL,18,     Fpricey sum.
